---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import editor from '../assets/editor.png';
---

<BaseLayout title="Meet the editor" description="Meet Zhanchao Yang, MCP & MUSA: Founder, Editor-in-Chief and Chair of the Editorial Board of The Unplanned Show.">
  <article class="profile container">
    <p class="profile__kicker">Editorial Leadership</p>

    <header class="profile__head">
      <div class="profile__titles">
        <h1>Meet Zhanchao Yang, MCP &amp; MUSA</h1>
        <p class="profile__deck">
          The Founder, Editor-in-Chief and Chair of the Editorial Board holds two master’s degrees, one
          publication and a quorum of one.
        </p>
        <p class="profile__byline">
          By <strong>The Unplanned Show Staff</strong>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span>Founder &amp; Editor-in-Chief, Chair of the Editorial Board</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="profile__figure">
        <Image src={editor} alt="Portrait of Zhanchao Yang, Founder and Editor-in-Chief" widths={[360, 540, 720]} sizes="(max-width: 48rem) 100vw, 360px" loading="eager" />
        <figcaption>Zhanchao Yang, Founder &amp; Editor-in-Chief. <span>All appointments were approved unanimously.</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </header>

    <div class="profile__body">
      <p>
        Zhanchao Yang holds a Master of City Planning and a Master of Urban Spatial Analytics from the Weitzman
        School of Design at the University of Pennsylvania (’26). He is also a recipient of the C. Britton Harris
        Award for excellence in transportation planning.
      </p>
      <p>
        During his graduate studies, he diligently attended studio reviews, drafted urgent memos on matters with
        limited urgency, and participated in site visits that confirmed the existence of the sites. He produced
        numerous maps of things already known, developed statistical models to explain the obvious patterns, and
        attended networking happy hours that resulted in neither networking nor happiness. His academic papers
        identified several research gaps, some of which he had personally created.
      </p>
      <p>
        Having spent an unusually long time in planning school compared with his peers, Yang eventually earned two
        master’s degrees while retaining only a limited understanding of what planning actually is, and continues to
        doubt it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Despite holding a MUSA degree and serving as a TA for Python, R and statistics four times, he still struggles
        to identify the difference between causation and correlation. He vibe coded multiple applications and
        assignments and left behind a substantial portfolio of software that no one is interested in maintaining.
      </p>
      <p class="profile__pull">The University nevertheless certified him as qualified.</p>
      <p>
        He founded <em>The Unplanned Show</em> to investigate this discrepancy without preparing another memo.
      </p>
      <p>
        Yang currently serves as Founder, Editor-in-Chief, and Chair of the Editorial Board. All appointments were
        approved unanimously.
      </p>
      <p class="profile__end"><strong>Board membership: 1. Quorum: 1.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .profile { padding-block: var(--space-xl) var(--section-gap-s); }
  .profile__kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 3px double var(--color-ink); max-width: none !important;
  }
  .profile__head {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 360px); gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: start; padding-block: var(--space-xl); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }
  .profile__titles h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-display-s); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display); font-weight: 700;
  }
  .profile__deck {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-lead);
    line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }
  .profile__byline {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg); padding-top: var(--space-sm); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .profile__byline strong { color: var(--color-ink); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; font-size: var(--text-xs); align-self: center; }
  .profile__figure { margin: 0; text-align: center; }
  .profile__figure img { width: min(100%, 300px); aspect-ratio: 1; margin-inline: auto; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 10%; }
  .profile__figure figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--space-xs); font-size: var(--text-xs); line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-muted);
  }
  .profile__figure figcaption span { color: var(--color-ink-2); }
  .profile__body { max-width: 680px; margin: var(--space-xl) auto 0; }
  .profile__body p { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1875rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: none !important; }
  .profile__body p + p { margin-top: var(--space-lg); }
  .profile__body > p:first-child::first-letter {
    float: left; font-size: 4.2rem; line-height: 0.82; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem 0 0; font-weight: 700;
  }
  .profile__pull {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl) !important; line-height: 1.25 !important; font-weight: 700;
    padding-block: var(--space-md); border-block: 1px solid var(--color-ink); text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .profile__end { font-family: var(--font-body) !important; font-size: var(--text-sm) !important; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; padding-top: var(--space-md); border-top: 3px double var(--color-ink); }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .profile__head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-lg); }
    .profile__figure { max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
